# Svelte 5 conventions

- Runes only (`$state`, `$derived`, `$effect`, `$props`). No `export let`, no Svelte 4 stores for local component state.
- Use the Svelte MCP tools: `list-sections` + `get-documentation` before writing unfamiliar patterns, `svelte-autofixer` before finishing any component.
- Loading state for any data-bearing component follows [docs/modules/loading.md](../../docs/modules/loading.md): render a skeleton shaped like the final content while data is pending, never a blank region or full-page spinner.
- shadcn-svelte primitives live in `$lib/components/ui/*` and are not hand-edited to patch one-off cases; compose around them instead.
- Keep components colocated with their route unless shared by 2+ routes, then promote to `$lib/components`.
